# EXHIBIT A — MASTER NOTICE OF MANDATORY PROCEDURAL ACCOMMODATION
### PURSUANT TO ARTICLE 13 & 21 OF THE UN CONVENTION ON THE RIGHTS OF PERSONS WITH DISABILITIES

---

## 🧭 0 — SYSTEM METADATA

* **Artifact Reference:** Exhibit A / Master Accommodation Notice
* **Regulatory Standard:** UNCRPD Article 13 (Access to Justice) & Article 21 (Freedom of Expression) [pdf_qh_98X.pdf]
* **Operational Mode:** Mandatory Static Annex — To be appended to all domestic and international pleadings [pdf_qh_98X.pdf].
* **Target Audience:** All Court Registrars, Adjudication Officers, Judges, and Legal Agents [pdf_jNQbfx.pdf, pdf_rN0GnW.pdf].

---

## 🧬 1 — FORMAL DECLARATION OF FUNCTIONAL DISABILITY & REQUIREMENT

The Claimant is a **neurodivergent human rights defender surviving severe complex trauma** directly stemming from cross-border state actions, illegal detainment, and multi-jurisdictional refoulement loops [pdf_Is8xuv.pdf, pdf_rN0GnW.pdf]. Untreated trauma and structural neurodivergence severely impair the capacity to execute highly regulated, multi-sentence written pleadings under adversarial time pressure [pdf_Kz7I2l.pdf]. 

Pursuant to the binding international mandates set forth below, the Claimant hereby **asserts their absolute, non-negotiable right to procedural adjustments** [pdf_qh_98X.pdf].

---

## 📡 2 — MANDATORY PROCEDURAL ADJUSTMENT INJUNCTIONS

### 1. Oral Communication as the Primary Mode of Access
* **The Mandate:** The Claimant **communicates primarily orally**. Oral communication must be accepted as the Claimant's primary interface with the judicial system [pdf_qh_98X.pdf].
* **The Rule:** The Tribunal/Court must permit the Claimant to provide oral statements, respond orally to questions, submit oral evidence, and conduct procedural conferences via interactive video or phone platforms [pdf_qh_98X.pdf].
* **Equivalency Status:** All oral statements must be recorded and transcribed by the forum, holding the exact same legal weight as formal written motions [pdf_qh_98X.pdf]. Written submissions shall be treated as secondary accommodations only [pdf_qh_98X.pdf].

### 2. Strict Prohibition of Written-Only Restrictions
* **The Gate:** Any attempt by a registrar or clerk to reject or block applications based on formatting, font size, or strict written-only rules (e.g., New Zealand High Court Rule 1.21(1)) is a **discriminatory denial of accommodation** [pdf_qzSYUi.pdf].
* **The Consequence:** Requiring a trauma survivor to articulate complex legal text under threat of dismissal creates an artificial barrier to justice [pdf_qh_98X.pdf]. This constitutes an active source of administrative retraumatization [pdf_qh_98X.pdf].

### 3. Transition to a Strictly Non-Adversarial Hearing Format
* **The Structure:** To satisfy the minimum standards of the **2022 Istanbul Protocol (Sections 69–71)**, all proceedings must adapt to a non-adversarial framework [pdf_qh_98X.pdf].
* **The Enforcement:** Hostile cross-examination, aggressive questioning by respondents, and face-to-face legal confrontation are completely banned [pdf_qh_98X.pdf]. All investigative queries must be passed to, filtered by, and delivered gently through the presiding Adjudication Officer or Tribunal Judge [pdf_qh_98X.pdf].

---

## 🎓 3 — BINDING LEGAL FOUNDATIONS & CRITERIA

* **UNCRPD Article 13 (Access to Justice):** Mandates that States Parties ensure effective access to justice for persons with disabilities on an equal basis with others, including through the provision of procedural and age-appropriate accommodations at all investigative and preliminary stages [pdf_qh_98X.pdf].
* **UNCRPD Article 21 (Freedom of Expression and Opinion):** Guarantees the right to choose oral, sign, or informal modes of communication as the primary means to express, seek, receive, and impart information [pdf_qh_98X.pdf].
* **UNCAT Article 16 (Prohibition of CIDT):** Forcing a vulnerable person to experience continuous administrative friction to access basic legal rights is defined by this engine as **Cruel, Inhuman, and Degrading Treatment** [pdf_qh_98X.pdf].

---

## 🧾 4 — SELF-EXECUTING INCORPORATION CLAUSE

This notice is a **permanent baseline invariant (\(\Omega\))** [pdf_d2Ix0Q.pdf]. It cannot be set aside by localized statutes, stamp duties, filing fees, or clerk rejections [pdf_9xx0U7.pdf, pdf_qzSYUi.pdf]. Any domestic body failing to provide these oral modes of participation automatically logs its own failure as an explicit **denial of domestic remedies**, immediately clearing the path for international jurisdiction [pdf_qh_98X.pdf, pdf_ui9Phv.pdf].
